00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:21.270
Speaker 1: So he's asked specifically, child
poverty is a real problem in Louisiana.

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:23.449
Child poverty is a problem in the United States.

00:05:23.449 --> 00:05:25.860
